      "statement": "The W1 five distribution tables, dim_expected_delay(_shift), and v2_cohort_remaining carry a body_type dimension with three tiers of rows (model, platform-prefix LEFT(body_type,2), 'ALL'); the consumer fallback chain is model -> LEFT(model,2) -> 'ALL' implemented in _model_tiers and the resolve_* functions, each tier usable only when its row's n meets the gate. The invariant that n is always the last column holds across all rows, so resolvers test row[-1] >= min_n and read statistics by explicit index; the delay tables deliberately invert mean/p50 order and must not be indexed positionally by the generic resolvers.",
