    {
      "id": "claim_c2709867804d47b5a70a24e97e49ad26",
      "statement": "spike_w3/01_boot_online.py treats the learning tables as existence-checked inputs: DSS_DIM_TABLES lists the W1 six tables, the W2 six v2_* tables, dim_expected_delay, and dim_weekly_plan (14 items). dim_expected_delay_shift is deliberately not in the required list so a missing optional table loads an empty dict and the resolver falls back to the shared row, letting the online service start cleanly without it.",
